{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "agenteam current Human Owner Artifact reads and inline content commands",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Current browser Session and Project Owner are rechecked by the original Service. GET/HEAD retain bounded reads and actual Read Audit. Three POST routes accept the same original inline content intent and idempotency key, with original Origin/CSRF protection. Server-owned attempts are independent of HTTP trace. The 2s business budget starts at handler entry; cancellation never replaces actual reader, prepared-payload discard, Audit, Store or handler return, including the original technical settle tail. No upload, Source, Agent provenance, signed download URL or raw Object access."
  },
